P-protect my sacred ground.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:47.250
You!

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:49.710
You must protect my sacred ground!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:54.960
The...

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:57.790
The tengu!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:02.130
What is it?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.130
It's the tengu, Ilya!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.540
Ilya! Ilya!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.580
Ilya, are you okay?!

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.880
Ilya! It's the tengu! The tengu!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.080
The tengu appeared!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.080
And... wow! It's huge!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.790
Goodness. So the tengu's real after-

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.040
Hey! Ilya!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.830
Papa...

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:47.960
Are you awake?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.210
Huh? Where am I?

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.960
Are you okay? Does your head hurt?

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:54.330
My head?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:56.460
I...!

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:57.830
I'm sorry!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:58.960
Asahi?

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:02.330
I didn't realize you were a girl.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.210
And I did all kinds of, well...

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:05.710
bad things, you could say.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.170
So, I'm sorry!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:10.500
Please, don't apologize. I really don't mind.

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:11.460
But...

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:15.710
Besides, it's my fault for pretending
to be a guy in the first place.

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.460
You forgive me?

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:20.710
There's nothing to forgive.
I was never annoyed with you.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:24.080
I'm more wondering if you're annoyed.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.290
Me? Why?

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:29.040
Because I've been lying all this time.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.540
When you kept talking about
forging a manly bond.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.080
You must have a reason, right?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.960
It was my father's dying wish.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.210
Your father's?

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.420
Yes.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:44.960
Apparently, he always wanted a boy.

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:49.960
So, ever since I was born,
he told me to live my life as a boy.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:55.630
My mother told me I didn't need
to be bound by those words anymore...

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.460
But I...

00:18:57.460 --> 00:18:59.330
What do you want to do?

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:05.790
Living as a guy, or living as a girl.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:07.460
Which would you prefer?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.210
I...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.250
I want...

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.750
I want to be the real me.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.380
To live as a girl!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:23.000
To be like Amelia, Karin, and the others,

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:27.290
living together in that house
as one of the girls!

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:28.790
I see.

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.790
Then be a girl.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.670
You should live life your way, Ilya.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:36.040
Right?

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.250
Asahi...

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:40.750
