00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:56.380
Still, it's kind of a shame for me
to be the only guy in the house.

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.080
Just kidding, okay?

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.040
Huh? Oh, right.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.670
Now, get some sleep.

00:20:04.670 --> 00:20:05.790
I'm going to bed too.

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:07.500
Um, Asahi.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.630
Thank you.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:14.130
