00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.710
And totally naked in the men's bath!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:36.710
Definitely a perverted exhibitionist tengu!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.710
What's so funny? It's true!

